PROPERTY LEASE AGREEMENT-Pothos Business LLC dba Bella Fuoco
This lease agreement is made and entered into the fourth of August, 2025 by and between Pot hos
LLC, whose address is 2115 Warren Ave, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001, (hereinafter referred to as
“Landlord")and Pothos Business LLC, whose address is 2115Warren Ave, Cheyenne, Wyoming
82001,(here in after referred toas“Tenant").
ARTICLEI-GRANT OF LEASE
Landlord, in consideration of therents tobe paid and the covenants and agreements to be
performed and observed the the Tenant, does hereby lease to the Tenant and the Tenant does
hereby lease and take from the Landlord all property and all improvements at 2115 Warren Ave,
Cheyenne, Wyoming,82001.Tenant does business as Bella Fuoco pizzeria.
ARTICLEII-LEASETERM
Section1.
Total Term of Lease.The term of this leases hall begin on the fourth of August,
2025, through thefourth of August,2035.
Section 2.
Rent. The tenant shall pay to the Landlord the sum of $6,500 per month, payable
on the first day of themonth, and shall be considered an advance payment for the month.
ARTICLEII-OTHER MATTERS
Landlord, Pothos LLC, hereby grants permission to the tenant, Pothos Business LLC, to sell or
sales of liquor andmalt beverages on the premises as granted under license by the State of
Wyoming Liquor Commission.
Signed this 30th day of June,2025.
