:01
Mayor Patrick Collins and Members of the City Council
2101O'Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, WY 82001
Subject: Liquor License Application-Bella Fuoco
Dear Mayor Collinsand City Council Members,
My name is Brenna Kosowicz, and I'm applying for a restaurant liquor license as the
new owner of Bella Fuoco Wood Fired Pizza.l'veworked at Bella Fuoco since2021
under Kelly and Eric Dalton, and have over three years of experience there, alongwith
additional roles at the Office Bar and Grill, Panera Bread, and Cheyenne Frontier Days.
After completing my degree in Sociology and working for the Department of Family
Services, I'vereturned to Bella Fuoco ful-time in preparation for ownership.I'm
committed to the responsible service of alcohol and will require staff to complete the
R serving certification, enforce strict ID checks, and maintain compliance logs.
Thank you for considering my application.I look forward to continuing Bella Fuoco's role
as a valued part of the Cheyenne community.
Sincerely,
Brenna Kosowicz
