Proposed Alcohol Training Program:
Allservers, bartenders, andFOH managers will be required tocomplete the Rserving
“Responsible Serving of Alcohol”course.Additionally, there will be a listkeptof eachserver's
server's certification expires, they are not allowed to serve without renewal.
Physical Description of Proposed Dispensing Rooms:
There are two dispensing rooms located on the premises.Oneis located in the interior, to the
Northof the cashier area, between the bar top and thekitchen.The dimensions are
approximately3'x6'.Thesecond dispensing room islocated on the Southwest comer of the
backpatio.The dimensions are approximately6'x12'.
